      "title": "Chinese luxury SUV transforms into a camper at push of a button",
      "content_html": "<p><img alt=\"The Stelato G9 offers a factory built-in rooftop tent as an option\" src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7daab54/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2202x1246+0+0/resize/1440x815!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fab%2Fe0%2F28ee5a4443a08c542b29cb06968a%2Fscreenshot-2026-08-03-at-3-10-41-pm.png\" /><p>Almost a month after Huawei executive Richard Yu (aka Yu Chengdong, 余承东), posted a cryptic message on his official Weibo social media account, it seems China is about to make waves in the competitive auto field of off-road SUVs.</p><p><a href=\"https://newatlas.com/outdoors/luxury-suv-transforms-into-camper/\">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/outdoors/\">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/huawei/\" rel=\"tag\">Huawei</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/suv/\" rel=\"tag\">SUV</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/tent/\" rel=\"tag\">Tent</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/off-road/\" rel=\"tag\">Off-road</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/e-auto/\" rel=\"tag\">ë-AUTO</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/electric/\" rel=\"tag\">Electric</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/china/\" rel=\"tag\">China</a></p>",
